deo/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVERYDAY HERO: Step into the boots of a U.S. firefighter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IGNITE YOUR PASSION: fight perilous fires in single- and multiplayer mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEAMWORK: 4-player coop mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNITED AGAINST FIRE: Assemble your squad with an NPC crew when in single-player mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AUTHENTICITY: Use equipment from leading U.S. firefighting brands, such as HAIX®, Fire-Dex and STIHL </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUICK RESPONSE: Drive faithfully reproduced, licensed Rosenbauer America fire trucks, such as the TP3® Pumper, Viper®, 68' Roadrunner, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOUR CAREER: Choose between 8 characters and different outfit sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIRESTATION: Your hub for learning techniques and choosing your next emergency mission(s).  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMULATION: Realistic fire, heat, water, and smoke simulation with the Unreal Engine 5 physics engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC MODDING: Create modding missions and share and play them over Mod io</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONSOLE MODDING: Download and play new modding missions from the Mod io hub</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669480/extras/ce91670c81fba4b778aa6c19e197890b.poster.avif?t=1784796095\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669480/extras/ce91670c81fba4b778aa6c19e197890b.webm?t=1784796095\" type=\"video/webm; cod